{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國天團BIGBANG近日在啟德主場館舉辦四場演唱會，場場座無虛席，現場一眾V.I.P（粉絲暱稱）氣氛熱烈。昨日（17日）來到尾場，V.I.P超級不捨，權志龍（G-Dragon）在台上發表感言，他公開感謝周潤發。</p><figure><img alt=\"G-Dragon表示周潤發是「Forever young super star」，更直指他是「香港精神」。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199509396892160000508439.jpeg/38i_ys4P-pxp-h_uGy1bUd4QXhTy0Fx8JKbBiiSmwYo\"/><figcaption>G-Dragon表示周潤發是「Forever young super star」，更直指他是「香港精神」。</figcaption></figure><p>GD台上驚喜致謝發哥</p><p>G-Dragon：「huge thank for our forever young super star Mr Chow Yun-fat 」。現場觀眾聽到GD多謝發哥，全場哄動，估計周潤發今晚亦是BIGBANG尾場的座上客。</p><figure><img alt=\"GD台上驚喜致謝發哥。(threads截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199522575298859008810476.jpeg/wVNHd36wNHT52NbYbJrIler-mQNTEBmOGTLN5RkyzeU\"/><figcaption>GD台上驚喜致謝發哥。(threads截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>其實二人之間的淵源甚深，早於2015年時，周潤發已在「MAMA頒獎禮」上頒獎給BIGBANG。而去年的「MAMA頒獎禮」，周潤發再次頒獎，不過今次只頒給G-Dragon。G-Dragon亦多次公開表示周潤發是他的偶像，非常喜歡他。相信G-Dragon借今次在港舉辦演唱會，向偶像周潤發致敬，同時亦有可能周潤發在現場，所以他特地「示愛」，不少網民都表示期待二人的合照。</p><figure><img alt=\"去年的「MAMA頒獎禮」，周潤發再次頒獎，不過今次只頒給G-Dragon。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199509721954914304798465.png/bqw2ZC8cah0vsWQBEcd3QuoCocBVS7gxJaByTyWgck8\"/><figcaption>去年的「MAMA頒獎禮」，周潤發再次頒獎，不過今次只頒給G-Dragon。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"相隔10年再獲偶像周潤發頒獎。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251129/1071573238200406016947652.jpeg/rTI2mHAQHq5AQfEWGOX1XSwbDIZC0N0SwJs428CbONs\"/><figcaption>相隔10年再獲偶像周潤發頒獎。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:47.189948+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":546,"images":4,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:05:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:51:02.988456+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:51:02.988456+00:00","content_hash":"072cefdb642a77c6c954c3d7686eeaecfc6f50467fae1c18ae9246909d6f84ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}